  "abilityDesc": "[BLIST][LI]+3 [icon:NAR_REW_COMBAT] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_COMBAT_STRENGTH_TOOLTIP]Combat Strength[/TIP] for [icon:UNIT] Units that are attacking in neutral or enemy territory.[LI]Gain 100 [icon:YIELD_CULTURE] Culture and [icon:YIELD_GOLD] Gold per [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_AGE_TOOLTIP]Age[/TIP] when you capture a [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_SETTLEMENT_TOOLTIP] Settlement[/TIP] for the first time.[LI]+10% [icon:YIELD_GOLD] Gold in all [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_SETTLEMENT_TOOLTIP] Settlements[/TIP], doubled in [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_SETTLEMENT_TOOLTIP]Captured Settlements[/TIP] from any Age.[LI]+1 [icon:SETTLEMENT_LIMIT] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_SETTLEMENT_LIMIT_TOOLTIP]Settlement Limit[/TIP] each [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_AGE_TOOLTIP]Age[/TIP].[/BLIST]",
  "agendaName": "Lord of Fire",
